"        Please acknowledge receipt of this document at your earliest convenience.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Best regards,<br/>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.distributed_by_id.name or user.name\"/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
